    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> casts the module's automated Enlarge/Reduce.</p><p><em>Potion, Rare</em></p><p>When you drink this potion, you gain the \"reduce\" effect of the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplEnlargeRed]{Enlarge/Reduce} spell for 1d4 hours (no Concentration required).</p><p>The red in the potion's liquid continuously contracts to a tiny bead and then expands to color the clear liquid around it. Shaking the bottle fails to interrupt this process.</p>",
